### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### 로그인
POST localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@email.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}

> {%
 var token = response.body.accessToken

 client
     .global.set("access_token", token)
 %}

### 액세스 토큰 검증
GET localhost:8080/test
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 새 유저 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gooc@naver.com",
  "password": "12341234",
  "nickname": "gooch123"
}

### 새 유저 로그인
POST localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gooch@naver.com",
  "password": "12341234"
}

### 리프레쉬 토큰 인증
POST localhost:8080/auth/refresh

### 로그아웃
POST localhost:8080/auth/logout

### 이메일 인증 요청
POST localhost:8080/auth/email/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gooch@naver.com"
}

### 이메일 인증
